 is from the film \'Forrest Gump\'?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"\u201cMy mama always said life was like a box of chocolates. You never know what you\'re gonna get\u201d is one of Forrest Gump\'s best-known lines, recalling advice from his mother.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218f9-3693-7362-9e9b-64882bb90146","description":"\"My mama always said life was like a box of chocolates. You never know what you\'re gonna get.\"","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218f9-3693-7b6f-8085-201c1b1b0e36","description":"\"Very nice!\"","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-3693-7ec8-a1da-d4d69031f094","description":"\"Say hello to my little friend!\"","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-3693-7c1d-a1dc-be6f952d5f7e","description":"\"Nobody makes me bleed my own blood. Nobody!\"","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218f9-3693-78d8-a522-338ba3570178","locale":"en-US","category":"01a21312-b489-796c-8b3c-aa437bd658ff","question":"Name the movie that matches the following plot summary: \'A small-time boxer gets a chance to fight the world heavyweight champion.\'","difficulty":1,"explanation":"Rocky won the Academy Award for Best Picture, and Sylvester Stallone wrote the screenplay and starred as the title character.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218f9-3693-76e4-9f88-b7afbdd2a9df","description":"Rocky","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218f9-3693-76a6-b351-7b47bbaaf194","description":"Am\u00e9lie","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-3693-7755-b579-d7b52a027147","description":"The Deer Hunter","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-3693-7fe7-9127-bc5803a9ffed","description":"Schindler\'s List","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218f9-3693-7832-a890-9787bc7746fb","locale":"en-US","category":"01a21312-b489-796c-8b3c-aa437bd658ff","question":"What is the plot of the movie The Wizard of Oz?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"The movie follows Dorothy and Toto after a tornado carries them to Oz, where she meets the Scarecrow, Tin Man, and Cowardly Lion while seeking a way home.","alternative