312-b489-796c-8b3c-aa437bd658ff","question":"Which of these quotes is from the film \'The Adventures of Sherlock Holmes\'?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"\u201cElementary, my dear Watson\u201d became a popular screen catchphrase, though Arthur Conan Doyle never used that exact wording in his stories.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218f9-3693-77cc-9880-334cc723f169","description":"\"Elementary, my dear Watson.\"","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218f9-3693-7db9-b807-8664b6358c16","description":"\"Keep your friends close, but your enemies closer.\"","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-3693-7938-b121-c4c49d802e0b","description":"\"My mother thanks you. My father thanks you. My sister thanks you. And I thank you.\"","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-3693-7f20-a51c-1dc872ba4bda","description":"\"My precious.\"","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218f9-3693-78ff-af02-8a032cf50c9a","locale":"en-US","category":"01a21312-b489-796c-8b3c-aa437bd658ff","question":"Who performed the theme song to the James Bond film Skyfall?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"Adele\u2019s \u201cSkyfall\u201d became the first James Bond theme to win the Academy Award for Best Original Song.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218f9-3693-79de-831b-6d805537ce21","description":"Adele","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218f9-3693-7e4f-951e-fcdf4b646dcc","description":"Jack White and Alicia Keys","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-3693-7c17-a74f-5985dc9604a1","description":"Madonna","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-3693-7cdf-a790-da8eecf40621","description":"Chris Cornell","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218f9-3693-7b6c-b022-0754e9834407","locale":"en-US","category":"01a21312-b489-796c-8b3c-aa437bd658ff","question":"Which Hollywood actor has starred in films including Interstellar and The Wolf of Wall Street?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"Matthew McConaughey won the Academy Award for Best Actor for playing Ron Woodroof in Dallas Buyers Club.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218f9-3693-76fb-a73f-ee